          "email": "timday@thelustrecollective.com",
          "date": "2026-06-09 19:02:24.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-20133 build: fix includes in posix_acl_to_xattr conftest",
        "message": "LU-20133 build: fix includes in posix_acl_to_xattr conftest\n\nOn Linux 7.0, header cleanups mean that <linux/posix_acl.h> no\nlonger gets a complete struct inode definition transitively and\nstruct mnt_idmap is not declared in scope. Including only\n<linux/posix_acl_xattr.h> thus fails to compile and the configure\ntest returns a false negative.\n\nFix this by including <linux/fs.h> in the conftest\nHAVE_POSIX_ACL_TO_XATTR_ALLOC_BUFFER.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nFixes: f85a7cf4c8d3 (\"LU-20133 build: Compatibility updates for kernel v7.0\")\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I4f6b170b40b2c0f46ccf857eda1a0e725c71ec78\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
